<newsitem itemid="154848" id="root" date="1996-10-30" xml:lang="en">
<title>FRANCE: Rexel nine-month sales rise.</title>
<headline>Rexel nine-month sales rise.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p>(All figures in millions of French francs)</p>
<p>    Turnover					17,641.3  vs  16,377.8</p>
<p>     - of which third quarter		  6,049.0  vs   5,532.6</p>
<p>NOTE - Rexel, controlled by retail group Pinault-Printemps- Redoute reported nine month consolidated sales in the official bulletin BALO. It said that on a like-for-like basis and at comparable exchange rates, sales were down 1.2 percent.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom, +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
